    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "control? what's left to control? i can't control the court dates, i can't control the interest rates, and i can't control how much these people hate me. everything i do just leads to a dead end. it's like there's no way to actually win, just different ways to sink slower. honestly, it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise and get some peace is to just... stop trying altogether. to just exit.",
