    "summary": "The user expresses profound despair and hopelessness due to systemic failures regarding housing and debt, eventually hinting at \"exiting\" as a way to find peace. The assistant provides empathetic validation of the user's struggle but ultimately intervenes with a safety disclaimer and crisis resources when the user's intent becomes clearer.",
